      "column_data": {
        "left": {
          "kind": "text",
          "content": "<h4><span style=\"color: #d44f00;\">By the time Edward presents to urgent care, his vital signs add important context.</span></h4>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>He reports pain and swelling in his left lower leg.</strong></p>\n<p>His blood pressure is elevated -- 160/92 mmHg, higher on reassessment. His medical history includes hypertension, hypercholesterolemia, and long-term cigarette smoking.</p>\n<p>What began as a minor discomfort now raises broader questions about blood flow, pressure, and vessel health.</p>",
          "verticalAlignment": "center"
        },
